                              <paragraph> 15 mL</paragraph>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                     </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <paragraph>*or as directed by a doctor</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240202"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="L604eb75c-fbc5-4f54-8b50-a2cb345de558">
               <id root="a746ab72-c827-424a-bd78-748aaa7cead2"/>
               <code code="60561-8" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTHER SAFETY INFORMATION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="italics">
                        <content styleCode="bold">Other information</content>
                     </content>
                     <br/>■ <content styleCode="bold">each 5 mL contains:</content> sodium 2 mg<br/>■ store between 20-2S° C (68-77° F)<br/>■ <content styleCode="bold">do not use if carton is opened or printed bottle</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">   neckband is broken or missing</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">■ see bottom panel for lot number and expiration date</content>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20240202"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="L7a623079-418e-4bf5-9970-4c58923a7d5d">
               <id root="553c2104-e8f0-47ef-acd2-cc9e0ce4bc52"/>
